      "id": "N3",
      "title": "断点续训 (checkpoint resumption): trainer 加 --resume-from + yaml output.checkpoint_interval=50 + start.sh auto-detect latest .pt",
      "type": "code_patch+yaml+start_sh",
      "file": "molmetal/scripts/train_dmpnn_multitask_wasserstein.py + configs/training/m17_pt_platinai_4cell_5seed_50ep_v1.yaml + scripts/start.sh",
      "status": "PENDING (design only; no code yet)",
      "est_loc": 120,
      "est_wall_cpu_min": 20,
      "deps": [
        "N1"
      ],
      "why_needed": "Per user voice 2026-10-03 verbatim: '训练我们要求是在不降低训练效率的前提下能够做到随时关闭但是可以断点续训的 (每50epoch保存一次断点好了, 这个得利用日志)'. 当前 trainer save checkpoint 只在训练完成时一次 (line 1015-1022), 没有每-N-epoch 保存 + 没有 resume 加载逻辑",
      "design": {
        "yaml_schema": {
          "output.checkpoint_interval": "50  # every N epochs; also save at final",
          "output.resume_from": "auto  # 'auto' = scan OUT_DIR/seed*/*.pt for latest; 'none' = cold start"
        },
        "trainer_changes": [
          "parser add_argument('--resume-from', choices=['auto', 'none', 'path'], default='auto')",
          "parser add_argument('--checkpoint-interval', type=int, default=50)",
          "save logic: if (epoch + 1) % args.checkpoint_interval == 0 OR epoch == epochs-1: save checkpoint with {model_state, optimizer_state, scheduler_state, epoch, best_val_auc, wasserstein_history}",
          "load logic: at start of train_one_metal_one_seed(): if resume_from == 'auto': scan ckpt_dir for dmpnn_mtw_{metal}_seed{seed}.pt, load model+optimizer+epoch, continue from epoch+1; if resume_from == 'none': cold start; if path: load specific .pt"
        ],
        "start_sh_changes": [
          "parse_yaml output.checkpoint_interval + output.resume_from",
          "pass via env var WFA5_CKPT_INTERVAL + WFA5_RESUME or append to ENTRY_COMMAND",
          "EXIT trap: on Ctrl+C / SIGTERM, write latest .pid + flush master.log + check for partial .tmp files"
        ],
        "backward_compat": "Default checkpoint_interval=50, resume_from='auto' = sane default; 'none' = current cold-start behavior; no breaking change to existing yaml configs"
      },
      "verify": [
        "§5.7 50-step CPU smoke: --resume-from none + --checkpoint-interval 5 saves at epoch 5 + reads .pt cleanly",
        "kill trainer mid-training via Ctrl+C + restart with --resume-from auto = picks up from saved epoch + loss curve continues",
        "master.log 包含 save/load events (per user voice '这个得利用日志')"
      ],
